title: '? A plan built in one mission by its author''s own specialist needs Tay alone, not Libby.'
pid: d4b8b3a3-1d79-48d3-b672-b53e952e029e
body: |2-
  Trial: on the next such plan, have Libby read it anyway, and count
  the changes she asks for that the builder would have tripped on.
  Libby has read one plan, Vic's, at the highest tier, and her reading
  changed it; what she adds to a plan of one territory is untried.
